senses.gloss:
मत + -अनुज्ञा one of the निग्रहस्थानs known in न्यायशास्त्र;
 Bhāṣā P.; admission of a fault in oneʼs own reasoning, while insisting
 on a similar one in that of the opponent.

—1 Envy, jealousy, spite, malice; अहो वस्तुनि मात्सर्यम् Ks. 21. 49;
 Ki. 3. 53; मात्सर्यमुत्सार्य विचार्य धूर्याः S. D.
—2 Displeasure.
